  "description": "The Traditional Trike gets an electric upgrade. We took our most popular full-sized trike and outfitted it with an all-new electric drive to give you a boost when needed. Powered by a 350w motor and 36-volt Li-ion smart battery, the E-350 has a 20-30 mile range and can be controlled using the handlebar-mounted throttle or simply left to do its thing in pedal-assist mode. The E-350 accepts a wide range of available accessories and gearing options to suit your particular needs and riding style.\nCustom oversized high-tensile steel Low-Step frame\nSingle-speed drivetrain\nAlloy crankset with sealed cartridge bottom bracket\nAlloy linear-pull front brake with parking lock\nAlloy mechanical rear disc brake with parking lock\nAlloy rims with 12/13g stainless steel spokes\n24\" x 1.75\" Multi-condition tires\n9\" High-rise steel handlebar and stem, foam grips\nSun Tractor saddle with heavy duty steel base\nSteel chain guard and nickel plated front fender\nVinyl coated steel wire basket\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------\n350 watt / 36 volt front hub motor\n36V / 10.4Ah lithium-ion rack-mount battery\n10 mph top speed / 20-30 mile range\nBottom bracket with integrated torque and cadence sensor\nDual mode pedal assist or throttle control operation",
